    <h3>Friends & Family</h3>
    <p class="audience-card__lead">Collaborate on everyday decisions, travel, and personal spaces with AI the whole group can use.</p>
    <ul class="audience-card__list">
      <li><strong>Vacation & Trip Planning:</strong> Research destinations, compare hotel rates, and build day-by-day itineraries together.</li>
      <li><strong>Major Purchases & Comparisons:</strong> Compare appliances, vehicles, or schools with multi-model analysis.</li>
      <li><strong>Household Spaces:</strong> Organize renovations, contractors, recipes, and family budgets in dedicated threads.</li>
      <li><strong>Shared AI Access:</strong> Space members can share authorized AI access with the group without exposing underlying credentials.</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="audience-card__cta">
      <a href="/use-cases/#family" class="link-arrow">Explore family use cases <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Audience 2: Teams & Companies -->
  <div class="audience-card">
    <div class="audience-card__icon-badge audience-card__icon-badge--teams">
      <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z"/><path d="m12 15-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z"/><path d="M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 0 5 0"/><path d="M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5"/></svg>
