    <h3>Software & Technical Teams</h3>
    <p class="audience-card__lead">Execute verified code implementation, automated testing, and multi-agent workflows on your machines.</p>
    <ul class="audience-card__list">
      <li><strong>Coding Agent Orchestration:</strong> Connect Codex CLI and local toolchains directly to your spaces.</li>
      <li><strong>Isolated Thread Runs:</strong> Safe parallel task execution with dedicated directories and runtime leases.</li>
      <li><strong>Automated Review & Evidence:</strong> Verify code changes with structured test runs, diffs, and independent model review.</li>
      <li><strong>Self-Hosted Workspaces:</strong> Keep execution entirely on your own local machines, servers, or secure cloud infrastructure.</li>
    </ul>
